========================================================================
Reading the result:
  |HL difference| < 0.005  -> the fixed reference makes no
     practical difference; GMCC's stability is attributable to
     global centering, not to holding mu fixed.
  HL difference clearly positive -> the fixed reference
     contributes to the reported stability and must be stated.
